/* ClaudeCompatible.swift */
"~/.qwen/settings.json has \"disableAllHooks\": true, so Qwen Code runs no hooks." = "~/.qwen/settings.json 中寫著 \"disableAllHooks\": true，Qwen Code 不會執行任何 hook。";
"Remove it (or set it to false), restart qwen, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "刪除這一項（或改成 false），重新啟動 qwen，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
"Gemini CLI runs hooks only in trusted folders: choose to trust the folder the first time you open gemini in a project." = "Gemini CLI 只會在信任的資料夾中執行 hook：第一次在專案中開啟 gemini 時，選擇信任該資料夾。";
"hooksConfig.enabled is false in ~/.gemini/settings.json, so Gemini CLI runs no hooks." = "~/.gemini/settings.json 中的 hooksConfig.enabled 為 false，Gemini CLI 不會執行任何 hook。";
"Set it to true (or remove it), restart gemini, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "改成 true（或刪除這一項），重新啟動 gemini，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
"The yaak hook is disabled in Gemini CLI (hooksConfig.disabled)." = "yaak hook 在 Gemini CLI 中已停用（hooksConfig.disabled）。";
"In gemini, run /hooks enable %@, or remove it from hooksConfig.disabled in ~/.gemini/settings.json, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 gemini 中輸入 /hooks enable %@，或從 ~/.gemini/settings.json 的 hooksConfig.disabled 中刪除它，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
"Droid runs no hooks in untrusted folders: choose to trust the folder the first time you open droid in a project." = "Droid 不會在未信任的資料夾中執行任何 hook：第一次在專案中開啟 droid 時，選擇信任該資料夾。";
"Droid has hooksDisabled set to true (~/.factory/settings.json or hooks.json), so it runs no hooks." = "Droid 的 hooksDisabled 為 true（~/.factory/settings.json 或 hooks.json），不會執行任何 hook。";
"Re-enable them with /hooks in droid, or remove the setting, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 droid 中輸入 /hooks 重新啟用，或刪除這項設定，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
"ZCode reads its hook config when a session starts: only sessions opened after installing will report." = "ZCode 在工作階段開始時讀取 hook 設定：安裝後新開啟的工作階段才會回報。";
"ZCode's main hook switch is off (hooks.enabled in ~/.zcode/cli/config.json)." = "ZCode 的 hook 總開關未開啟（~/.zcode/cli/config.json 中的 hooks.enabled）。";
"Turn it on in ZCode under Settings → Hooks, or set hooks.enabled to true, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 ZCode 的「設定 → Hooks」中開啟，或將 hooks.enabled 改成 true，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
"YaaKanban's %@ hooks are disabled in ZCode." = "YaaKanban 的 %@ hook 在 ZCode 中已停用。";
"Turn them back on in ZCode under Settings → Hooks, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "在 ZCode 的「設定 → Hooks」中重新開啟，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
/* Cline.swift */
"Cline's hooks in VS Code follow its “Enable Hooks” switch (on by default). Cline has no permission-request hook, so approvals still happen in Cline. A task that errors in VS Code fires no hook, so its card ends only when stuck detection kicks in." = "Cline 在 VS Code 中的 hook 受「Enable Hooks」開關控制（預設開啟）。Cline 沒有權限請求 hook，因此仍需在 Cline 中核准。VS Code 中出錯的任務不會觸發 hook，卡片要等到卡住偵測生效才會結束。";
/* DeepSeek.swift */
"dsh hooks are an experimental interface: no approvals, no session-end event, and no transcript." = "dsh 的 hook 是實驗性介面：沒有核准、工作階段結束事件，也沒有 transcript。";
"In a terminal, run: dsh plugin --profile web add file:%@" = "在終端機中執行：dsh plugin --profile web add file:%@";
"For another profile, replace web with its name (headless, acp…); add it once for each profile you use." = "若使用其他 profile，將 web 換成它的名稱（headless、acp…）；每個使用的 profile 都要加入一次。";
"Restart dsh, then come back and click “Recheck”." = "重新啟動 dsh，再回到這裡按一下「重新檢查」。";
/* Hermes.swift */
"Before Hermes first runs a new hook, it asks you in the terminal to allow each one." = "Hermes 第一次執行新的 hook 前，會在終端機中逐一詢問你是否允許。";
"Run hermes once in a terminal." = "在終端機中執行一次 hermes。";
